arbeitnow:engineering-manager-server-dri:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Engineering Manager to lead Codeless, our internal Server-Driven UI (SDUI) platform team. In this role, you will lead a cross-functional team bridging mobile/web frontend engineering and core platform backend systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this role is deeply rooted in modern UI architecture, its mission goes beyond standard UI development: Codeless empowers product teams across the organization to ship dynamic, native UI experiences dynamically from the backend—eliminating app store release bottlenecks, dramatically accelerating feature iteration, and establishing a unified UI schema across iOS, Android, and Web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role with broad impact, from hands-on technical guidance to championing web and mobile accessibility across the company. We're looking for a leader who excels at fostering collaboration and can confidently guide a concept from initial idea to robust implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Build, mentor, and scale an engineering team responsible for our core Server-Driven UI platform ("Codeless"). Foster an inclusive, high-ownership engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Architecture &amp;amp; Evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the design and evolution of dynamic layout engines, declarative UI schemas, and client rendering frameworks across iOS, Android, and Web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developer Velocity &amp;amp; Platform Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with product feature teams to drive internal adoption of Codeless. Ensure the platform provides exceptional Developer Experience, clear tooling, robust design system integration, and seamless debugging workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Execution &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Set high technical standards for platform performance, payload optimization, caching strategies, backward compatibility, and graceful offline/fallback behavior across client devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Product Managers, Design System leaders, and Core Infrastructure engineers to align the Codeless roadmap with broader company initiatives and global design paradigms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll need to thrive&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Management:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of experience managing software engineering teams, with a track record of coaching engineers, delivering complex platform initiatives, and driving technical strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UI &amp;amp; Platform Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundational background in mobile (iOS/Android) or modern web architecture (React, SwiftUI, Jetpack Compose, or declarative UI paradigms).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Platform Mindset:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Ability to treat internal product engineering teams as customers, evaluating platform success through developer velocity, adoption metrics, and rendering performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why join us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 A culture built for builders High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our Tech Blog.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Explore our Engineering Interview Guide here to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands' legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class="_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1" href="http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness" data-renderer-mark="true" data-is-router-link="false" data-testid="link-with-safety"&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-partner-sales-manager-l:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are a global team of innovators and pioneers dedicated to shaping the future of observability. At New Relic, we build an intelligent platform that empowers companies to thrive in an AI-first world by giving them unparalleled insight into their complex systems. As we continue to expand our global footprint, we're looking for passionate people to join our mission. If you're ready to help the world's best companies optimize their digital applications, we invite you to explore a career with us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id="model-response-message-contentr_9a2fd7fcfa95277b" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering"&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="2"&gt;Your Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="3,0"&gt;Are you looking to take your enterprise sales or alliance management career to the next level by driving growth for one of the industry's most critical cloud channels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="3,2"&gt;? At New Relic, we believe in the power of data to create better software and exceptional digital experiences and our cloud partners are right at the heart of how we scale that vision globally&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="3,4"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="4,0"&gt;As our &lt;strong data-path-to-node="4,0" data-index-in-node="7"&gt;Senior Cloud Partner Sales Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you won't just be managing partnerships; you will act as a pivotal growth engine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="4,2"&gt;. You will bridge the gap between our internal sales leadership and our cloud partner counterparts at Amazon Web Services (AWS) and Microsoft Azure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="4,4"&gt;. If you want the autonomy to build deep network relationships, align go-to-market strategies, and accelerate high-velocity co-sell motions that directly influence pipeline revenue, this is the place to do it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="4,6"&gt;. You'll join a collaborative, inclusive environment where data-driven ideas win, giving you the space to innovate and elevate your professional profile alongside top industry talent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="4,8"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="6"&gt;What You'll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="7"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="7,0,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Drive Strategy &amp;amp; Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the strategic bridge between New Relic’s sales leaders (AVPs, RVPs, and Account Executives) and AWS/Azure partner sales teams to ensure seamless collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="7,0,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="7,1,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Execute Co-Sell Motions:&lt;/strong&gt; Map accounts, identify new logos, and accelerate deal cycles by leveraging AWS Marketplace and Azure Marketplace (CPPO/MPO)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="7,1,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="7,2,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Generate Qualified Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Build regional partner plans that fuel business growth, making full use of cloud provider funding programs, incentives, and consumption credits (EDPs/MACC)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="7,2,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="7,3,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Build &amp;amp; Evangelise Cloud Networks:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate deep, trusted relationships with Partner Development Managers (PDMs), Cloud Account Managers, and field leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="7,3,0,2"&gt;. Educate partner teams so New Relic remains top-of-mind for cloud migration and observability initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="7,3,0,4"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="7,4,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="7,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Lead Governance &amp;amp; QBRs:&lt;/strong&gt; Own Quarterly Business Reviews with internal and external stakeholders to track performance, celebrate wins, and ensure long-term pipeline health&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="7,4,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="9"&gt;This Role Requires&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="10"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="10,0,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="10,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Ecosystem Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Substantial background in successfully managing AWS or Microsoft Azure partnerships within an Enterprise Software, SaaS, or Alliance Management environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="10,0,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="10,1,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="10,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Co-Sell Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record of navigating cloud provider field structures, co-sell programs, and cloud marketplace mechanisms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="10,1,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="10,2,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="10,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Sales Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong familiarity with complex enterprise sales cycles and a demonstrated ability to partner effectively with Enterprise Account Executives to close deals faster&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="10,2,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="10,3,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="10,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Collaborative Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding communication skills with a proven ability to influence, align, and inspire cross-functional teams and external stakeholders without relying on direct authority&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="10,3,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="12"&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="13"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="13,0,0,0"&gt;Simultaneous, hands-on experience managing &lt;strong data-path-to-node="13,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="43"&gt;both&lt;/strong&gt; AWS and Azure co-sell ecosystems at scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="13,0,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="13,1,0,0"&gt;Practical familiarity with observability, application performance monitoring (APM), or cloud infrastructure operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="13,1,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="13,2,0,0"&gt;Existing networks and active relationships with AWS or Microsoft Partner Development Managers (PDMs) and regional sales teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="13,2,0,2"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node="15,0"&gt;#LI-Remote #LI-JJ2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fostering a diverse, welcoming and inclusive environment is important to us. We work hard to make everyone feel comfortable bringing their best, most authentic selves to work every day. We celebrate our talented Relics’ different backgrounds and abilities, and recognize the different paths they took to reach us – including nontraditional ones. Their experiences and perspectives inspire us to make our products and company the best they can be. We’re looking for people who feel connected to our mission and values, not just candidates who check off all the boxes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require a reasonable accommodation to complete any part of the application or recruiting process, please reach out to &lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;We believe in empowering all Relics to achieve professional and business success through a flexible workforce model. This model allows us to work in a variety of workplaces that best support our success, including fully office-based, fully remote, or hybrid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In compliance with applicable law, all persons hired will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work and to complete employment eligibility verification. Note: Our stewardship of the data of thousands of customers means that a criminal background check is required to join New Relic.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We will consider qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records based on individual circumstances and in accordance with applicable law including, but not limited to, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://sfgov.org/olse/sites/default/files/FCO%20poster2020.pdf" target="_blank"&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. New Relic does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes, and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with New Relic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New Relic develops and distributes encryption software and technology that complies with U.S. export controls and licensing requirements. Certain New Relic roles require candidates to pass an export compliance assessment as a condition of employment in any global location. If relevant, we will provide more information later in the application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates are evaluated based on qualifications, regardless of race, religion, ethnicity, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, age, disability, neurodiversity, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review our Applicant Privacy Notice at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://newrelic.com/termsandconditions/applicant-privacy-policy" target="_blank"&gt;https://newrelic.com/termsandconditions/applicant-privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-facilities-manager-derb:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;About The Team:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As the Senior Facilities Manager, you will lead all aspects of facilities and maintenance operations across the site, ensuring a safe, efficient, and high-performing environment. You'll oversee building and equipment maintenance, contractor and vendor relationships, budgets, and compliance, while driving continuous improvement and operational excellence. Leading a team of Facilities colleagues, you'll inspire high performance, deliver against key KPIs and objectives, and ensure the site operates to the highest standards of safety, quality, and cost-effectiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1jh6prp" data-start="28" data-end="179"&gt;Lead, motivate, and develop the Facilities &amp;amp; Maintenance team to achieve outstanding performance and help every colleague reach their full potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="6lt1cq" data-start="180" data-end="303"&gt;Oversee the day-to-day operation of site facilities, ensuring a safe, efficient, and high-performing working environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="quqzkb" data-start="304" data-end="444"&gt;Manage and coordinate maintenance teams and contractors, ensuring all work is completed efficiently, safely, and to the highest standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="o6xcnk" data-start="445" data-end="578"&gt;Act as the first point of contact for colleague queries, working closely with HR, Training, and other support teams where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="17cbdgv" data-start="579" data-end="688"&gt;Drive continuous improvement initiatives that enhance operational performance, reliability, and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="xlucbk" data-start="689" data-end="837"&gt;Lead facilities procurement activities, including tendering and RFP processes, to secure best value and effective facilities management solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1ti84o8" data-start="838" data-end="963"&gt;Implement and optimise central Building Management System (BMS) dashboards to improve visibility, control, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1kollsx" data-start="964" data-end="1090"&gt;Manage facilities and maintenance budgets, identifying opportunities to maximise value while maintaining service excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1hcnu7f" data-start="1091" data-end="1243"&gt;Build strong relationships with suppliers, evaluating contracts and negotiating commercial terms to achieve cost savings without compromising quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="ekskyz" data-start="1244" data-end="1404"&gt;Identify, investigate, and resolve operational issues, escalating complex challenges to the Facilities &amp;amp; Maintenance senior leadership team where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1ky8w78" data-start="1405" data-end="1526"&gt;Ensure full compliance with Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs), work instructions, and all relevant company policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="6enake" data-start="1527" data-end="1735"&gt;Champion a culture of Food Safety and Health &amp;amp; Safety, ensuring compliance with legal requirements and recognised standards, including BRCGS and ISO, while promoting a proactive approach to risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="sktqr3" data-start="1736" data-end="1888"&gt;Conduct regular audits, track corrective actions, and drive continuous compliance across Food Safety, Health &amp;amp; Safety, and other regulatory standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1cbb8wo" data-start="1889" data-end="2071" data-is-last-node=""&gt;Promote a strong safety culture by reporting incidents promptly, encouraging colleagues to raise concerns, and taking responsibility for maintaining a safe and compliant workplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer" data-start="23" data-end="36"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="23" data-end="36"&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start="38" data-end="1123"&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1s84q4u" data-start="38" data-end="160"&gt;Proven experience in facilities and maintenance management, with a strong track record of leading high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="doq93p" data-start="161" data-end="250"&gt;Strong knowledge of building systems, maintenance practices, and facilities operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1er2hdw" data-start="251" data-end="362"&gt;Experience managing maintenance budgets, projects, and contractors to deliver safe, cost-effective solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1dn5gsf" data-start="363" data-end="468"&gt;Solid understanding of health &amp;amp; safety legislation, compliance requirements, and operational standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="w0o35y" data-start="469" data-end="554"&gt;Knowledge of Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs) and quality management standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="117q80j" data-start="555" data-end="647"&gt;A continuous improvement mindset, using data and insights to drive operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="k0zdg1" data-start="648" data-end="738"&gt;Ability to foster a culture of high performance, safety, compliance, and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="u4ab9e" data-start="739" data-end="823"&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced, dynamic environment with changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1w53r2y" data-start="824" data-end="915"&gt;Proven ability to coach, develop, and inspire colleagues to achieve their full potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="qinkpp" data-start="916" data-end="1009"&gt;Demonstrated leadership experience managing performance and driving operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="gquslx" data-start="1010" data-end="1123"&gt;Experience managing employee relations matters, including disciplinary processes up to and including dismissal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1125" data-end="1138"&gt;&lt;strong data-start="1125" data-end="1138"&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start="1140" data-end="1339" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="v8blwz" data-start="1140" data-end="1251"&gt;Bachelor's degree in Facilities Management, Engineering, or a related discipline (Master's degree desirable).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="b6dcf2" data-start="1252" data-end="1339" data-is-last-node=""&gt;Experience managing Material Handling Equipment (MHE) and waste management contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
